; medium TRAP: SORT o_status DESC NL then o_date ASC NF, ties stable on o_id; NL/NF must keep their meaning under DESC. Filter on o_qty after the sort can move before it
LOAD   id, orders.o_id
LOAD   st, orders.o_status
LOAD   dt, orders.o_date
LOAD   q, orders.o_qty
SORT   p, st DESC NL, dt ASC NF
GATHER a, id, p
GATHER b, st, p
GATHER c, dt, p
GATHER d, q, p
GE     m, d, 5
IDX    i, m
GATHER a2, a, i
GATHER b2, b, i
GATHER c2, c, i
OUT    a2, b2, c2
